ch the side of \"the bowl,\" as named by fishermen, across from the shallow beach, for a quiet spot to cast away.","wo":"Seetal ci \"wetu bool bi\" ni ko nappkat yi di woote, nga dem fu xóotul bu baax te teey nga ser fa gaal gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSeetal thi \"wetu bool bi\" niko napkat yi di woté, nga dem fou khotoul bou bakh té téy nga ser fa gaal gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":349,"row":{"en":"I took the fiber away from her and showed it to my mom.","wo":"Ci laa nango fibre bi daal di koy wan sama yaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi la nango fibre bi daldi koy wan sama yayé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":350,"row":{"en":"Think about what kind of blue jeans you wish to fit into later on.","wo":"Xalaatal ban xetu jiin bu bula nga bëgg mu japp la ëllëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalatal bane kheutou djinn boula nga beugue mou diap la eu leugé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":351,"row":{"en":"On the day of the test, I arrived at the DMV early and took my seat in the waiting room.","wo":"Bisu examen bi, ma teela yegsi ci DMV bi ma toog sama plaas ci saal bi ñuy xaaree.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBissou examé bi ma téla yeugsi thi DMV bi ma togue sama place si salle bi gnuy kharé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":352,"row":{"en":"With our service, you'll never have to worry about missing out on a great deal again.","wo":"Sooy jëfandikoo sunu serwiis, dootoo jaaxle di xalaat ndax amul xéewal yu la rëccaat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy dieufandiko souniou service, dooto diaxle di khalaat ndakh amoul kheewal youla reuthiaat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":353,"row":{"en":"Patient: Will it hurt?","wo":"Malaad bi: Day metti?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi day meti ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":354,"row":{"en":"For many Jews, eating kosher food is a way to show their 