am suko defee nga teela ràññee jafe-jafe yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSegal taneefi tontou si bou nekk ak goham wala bisam souko défé nga téla ragne djafé-djafé yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":360,"row":{"en":"Write about Pam's ill-fated relationship with the handsome salesman.","wo":"Nettaliñu dingante bu mujjee ci safaan bu Pam ak jaaykat bu rafet bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNettalinou dinganté bou moudjéé si safane bou Pam ak djaykat bou raféte bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":361,"row":{"en":"Next, use local mobile advertising to attract foot traffic.","wo":"Bi ci topp, wuttal xarala yu yeess yi ngir jallalé say yeglé ba meuna am doxkatt yu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi si top woutal kharala you yess yi nguir dialalé say yeglé ba meuna ame dokhate you bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":362,"row":{"en":"This statement will almost certainly get me into a great deal of hot water.","wo":"Wax jii ma wax ragal naa ni dina ma jural coow lu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWakhou dji ma wakh ragal nani dina ma dioural thiow lou bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":363,"row":{"en":"They encouraged me to go to college, to get a job, and to live my life on my own terms.","wo":"Ñu ñaaxma ma dem universite, wut liggéey suko ba noppi dundu sama dundu nimu ma soobee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou gnakh ma ma dem université, wout liguey souko ba noppi doundou sama doundou nimou ma sobé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":364,"row":{"en":"She can do things with her tongue most of us can't even fathom, like touch her elbow or lick her own ear.","wo":"Mën na def ak làmmiñam lu bari lu nit ñi mënul lu ci melni teg lamiñam ci concam wala noppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun na def ak lamigname lou bari lou nitt gni meunoul lou thi melni teg lamigname thi concam wala noppam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":365,"row":{"en":"Despite the potential dangers, rainstorms can also be beneficial.","wo":"Doonte amna am loraange, taw mën na am njariñ itam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoonté amna am lorangé taw meun na am ndiarign itam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":366,"row":{"en":"The woman's experience is a reminder of the importance of being prepared when hiking in the mountains.","wo":"Loolu dal ndaw soosu daf ñuy fàttali ni, balaa ngay dem yéeg tundu danga wara waajal sa bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou dal ndaw sosou daf gnouy fattali ni bala ngay dem yég toundou danga wara wadial sa boppé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":367,"row":{"en":"It is bordered by Angola to the west, the Democratic Republic of the Congo to the north, Tanzania to the northeast, Malawi to the east, Mozambique to the southeast, Zimbabwe to the south, and Botswana to the southwest.","wo":"Angola mooko féete sowwu, Republique Democratique bu Congo RDC mooko féete nord, Tanzanie mooko féete nord est, Malawi ci est bi, Mozambique ci sud est bi, Zimbabwe ci sud bi, ak Botswana ci sud ouest bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAngola moko fété sowou, republique democratique bou congo rdc moko fété nord, tanzanie moko fété nord est, malawi thi est bi, mozambique thi sud est bi, zimbabwe thi sud bi ak botswana thi sud ouest bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":368,"row":{"en":"Ambedkar was also a key figure in the drafting of the Constitution of India.","wo":"Ambedkar def na liggéey bu am solo bi ñuy bind sàrtu ndayu réewum Inde.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmbedkar defna liguey bou am solo bignouy bind sartou ndayou réewoum Inde.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":369,"row":{"en":"The sphere was hovering in the air, and it was surrounded by a faint aura.","wo":"Bul bi dafa doon wëréelu ci jawwu ji, mu amaale aura bu ko wër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoul bi dafa done weurelou si djaw dji mou amalé aura bouko weur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":370,"row":{"en":"We instantly recognize this feature as defining an unnatural, hence anti-biophilic, environment.","wo":"Danuy xàmmee ci saasi ni màndarga bii di fësalee environmaa bu naturelul te daa bëggul environmaa bi (anti-biophilic).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanouy khamé thi sassi ni màndarga bii di feussalé environmaa bou natureloul té da beugoul environmaa bi (anti-biophilic).\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":371,"row":{"en":"Personal behaviors related to cancer risk (smoking, alcohol consumption, sun exposure).","wo":"Li nit ki tàmm di def te mu mën ko jural cancer (tóx, naan sàngara, yàgg ci naaj).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi nitt ki tamm di def té mou meun ko djural cancer (toh, nane sangara, yagg si nadj)\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":372,"row":{"en":"When we can see ourselves in this way, it becomes easier to let go of the things that we think we need to be happy.","wo":"Sudee mën nanu gisee noonu sunu bopp, dina nu mëna teggi sunu bakkan ci mbir yi nu yaakaar ni ñooy féexal sunu xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé meun nagnou guissé nonou souniou bopp dina gnou meuna tegui souniou bakane thi mbir yi gnou yakar ni gnoy fékhale souniou khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":373,"row":{"en":"It's not easy to be on the receiving end of someone's anger.","wo":"Yombul nit di dëkke sotti xaqaram sa kaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYomboul nitt di deuke sotti khakaram sa kaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":374,"row":{"en":"One day, Ramasamy arrested a young man named Krishnan for a crime he did not commit.","wo":"Benn bis, Ramasamy daal di jàpp benn xale bu góor bu tuddu Krishnan ci krim bumu deful.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss Ramasamy daldi diap benn khalé bou goor bou toudou Krishnan thi krim boumou déffoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":375,"row":{"en":"Your creations are too beautiful. They are stealing life from the world.","wo":"Li ngay yatt daa rafet bamu ëpp. Yaa ngi sàcc dundu ci àdduna bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi ngay yat da rafét bamou eup. Yaa ngui sath doundou si addouna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":376,"row":{"en":"One such flapper is named Josephine.","wo":"Josephine kenn la ci flapper yooyu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJosephine kène la si flappeur yoyou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":377,"row":{"en":"To know that there's someone out there who's better than you.","wo":"Nga xamni amna keneen ci biti ku la gën.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNga khamni amna kenen thi biti koula gueuné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":378,"row":{"en":"Hence, every food item made of grain got scarcer, rural income declined, and every farmer fell deeper into debt.","wo":"Bépp ñam buñ defaree pepp dafa jafee gis, waa àll baa ngi gëna ndóol, baykat bi di gëna nekk ci bor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeupp niam bougnou defaré pepp dafa diafé guiss, wa all ba ngui geuna ndool, baykat bi di geuna nekk thi bor.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":379,"row":{"en":"His nervous, awkward kisses were sweeter than his father’s honey.","wo":"Ay fóoni tàng xol yu kenn xamul lumuy nuru, ñoo dàq yu xolu pàppaam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy fooni tang khol you kene khamoul loumouy nourou nio dak you kholou papaam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":380,"row":{"en":"This is because Jesus is the perfect expression of God's love for us.","wo":"Liko waral mooy Jesus mooy misaal bi leer ci mbëggeelu Yàlla ci nun.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiko waral moy jesus moy misal bi leer thi mbeuguelou yalla thi nioune.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":381,"row":{"en":"The whisk is a whisk, the tongs are tongs, and the ladle is a ladle.","wo":"Fuwe, fuwe la, keppukaay, keppukaay la, te luus, luus la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFouwe, fouwé la, kepeukay, kepeukay la, té louss, louss la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":382,"row":{"en":"He told me that the rash was probably just a reaction to the tick's saliva.","wo":"Muni ma tëndandiir yiy feeñ ci sama yaram, amaana tiflitu kutt moo ko waral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouni ma teundandiir yiy feegn thi sama yaram, amaana tiflito kutt moko waral.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":383,"row":{"en":"He wandered around for hours, admiring the plants and dreaming of the beautiful garden he would create.","wo":"Mu doxantu ay waxtu ci biir, bi bégé garab yi, xelam dem ci jardin bu rafet bi mu nara defar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui dokhantou ay wakhtou thi biir bi, bi beugué garab yi, khélam dem thi jardin bou rafet bi mou nara defar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":384,"row":{"en":"He loved them so much that he would eat them for breakfast, lunch, and dinner.","wo":"Daf ko bëggoon ba mooy lay ndékkee, di ko añee ak di ko reeree.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafko beugone ba moy lay ndéké, diko agné ak diko réré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":385,"row":{"en":"The loaves were perfectly browned and had a delicious aroma that made his mouth water.","wo":"Miisu mburu yi xonk nañu bu baax, boole ci xet gu neex guy wannaasuloo képp kumu xeeñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMissou mbeurou yi honk nagnou bou bakh, boolé thi kheut gou nekh guy wannasoulo képp kou mou khégn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":386,"row":{"en":"I gently stroke her head and tell her that everything is going to be okay.","wo":"Ma raayal ko dànk boppam ba noppi niko lépp dina baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa rayal ko dank boppam ba noppi niko lepp dina bakhé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":387,"row":{"en":"Burn it and let it go.","wo":"Lakk ko mu jeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLakk ko mou diekh rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":388,"row":{"en":"Chronic inflammation can also be caused by obesity, smoking, and air pollution.","wo":"Yaram wu bari, tóx sigaret ak polusioŋ mën nañu indi inflamasioŋ budul jeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaram wou bari, tokh sigaret ak polution meun nagnou indi inflammation boudoul diékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":389,"row":{"en":"It could be a beach, a forest, or a mountaintop.","wo":"Mën na nekk booru géej, àll, wala ci kaw aw tundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun na neuk booru guedj, alle, wala thi kaw toundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":390,"row":{"en":"The researchers say that these findings are important because they highlight the need for women to understand the risks and benefits of breast cancer screening before they decide whether or not to undergo a mammogram.","wo":"Gëstukat yi dañu wax ni njariñu li gëstu bi wane mooy jigéen ñi wara def test dañu leen wara jot bépp leeral bi war ngir lépp leer seen bopp, ñu xam risk ak njariñ yi ci nekk yépp balaa ñuy jël dogalu def mamograam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGuestoukat yi daniou wakh ni ndiarignou li guestou bi wané moy djiguéne gni wara def test daniou léne wara diot bépp leeral bi war nguir lép leer séne bopp, gnou kham risk ak ndiarign yi thi nekk yépp bala gnouy dieul dogalou def mamogram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":391,"row":{"en":"The blood was collected in a bag, and the whole process took about 15 minutes.","wo":"Ñu taataan deret ji ci mbuus, te liggéey bi yépp weesul 15 simili.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou tatane deret dji thi mbouss té liguey bi yeup wessoul 15 simili.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":392,"row":{"en":"Hikers should always bring a map, compass, and a flashlight, and they should tell someone where they are going and when they expect to return.","wo":"Kuy yéeg tundu danga wara yóbbaale kàrt, busol, làmp-tors, ba noppi nga am koo tàggu wax ko fi nga jëm ak kañ nga yaakaara dellusi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKouy yégue toundou danga wara yobalé kart, boussol, lamp-torche, ba noppi nga ame ko tagou wakh ko fi nga dieum ak kan gnaga yakara delloussi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":393,"row":{"en":"For example, you might set a goal to lose weight, get a promotion at work, or travel to a new place.","wo":"Ci misaal mën nga ni dangay wàññi sa yaram, danga am promo ci sa liggéey, wala dangay tukki ci barab bu bees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi misal meun nga ni dangay wagn sa yaram, danga ame promo ci sa liguey, wala dangay touki ci barab bou bess.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":394,"row":{"en":"In-unit laundry, solid core doors, high-end carpet, custom window treatments and large garage parking space included.","wo":"Amaale na fóotookaay, buntu ame pleen, moket bu muccu ayib, palanteer yu mengook bëgg-bëggu boroom, ak gaaraas yu yaatu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmaale na fotokai, bount ame pleen, moket bou mutheu ayib, palanteer you mengook beug beugou borom, ak garaas you yaatou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":395,"row":{"en":"You'll definitely sleep a little bit better during that long train ride.","wo":"Soof amal tukki bu yàgg ci train ci ngay mëna nelaw bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoof amal touki bou yagg thi train thi ngay meuna nelaw bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":396,"row":{"en":"Once upon a time, there was a little boy named Juan who loved tacos.","wo":"Amoon na fi benn xale bu góor bu tuddu Juan. Juan ku bëggoon tacos la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoon nafi ben khalé bou goor bou toudou Juan. Juan kou beugone tacos la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":397,"row":{"en":"The firmware upgrade progress depends on the overall load of the system.","wo":"Gaawaayu yeesal losisielu jumtukaay baa ngi aju ci li sistem bi yab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGaawayou yeesal losisielou jumtoukay ba ngui adjou thi li system bi yab.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":398,"row":{"en":"She couldn't take the stress of the job anymore, and she knew that she wouldn't be able to advance her career there.","wo":"Mënatul woon dékku benn stress ci liggéeyam, te xamna ni du musa mëna awaase ci liggéeyam su fa desee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeunatoul wone deukou ben stress si ligueyam té khamna ni dou meussa meuna awaassé si ligueyam sou fa dessé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":399,"row":{"en":"A: But some people say that the dowry system is a way to protect women.","wo":"A: Waaye ñenn ñi dañu jàpp ni pexe la muy aar ku jigéen ki.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé gnén gni dagnou diap ni pékhé leu mouy aar kou djiguéne ki.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}